pstack for AgenC: unofficial adaptation
=======================================

This folder is a modified copy of pstack by Lauren Tan, taken from the
cursor/plugins repository (this repo is a fork of it):

  Source:   https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack
  Commit:   d457567332aa6989e753ea289f30ea2bfbc80bc0 (pstack version 0.15.28)
  License:  MIT, see LICENSE (kept verbatim, Copyright (c) 2026 Lauren Tan)

It is not an official release and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
pstack author or Cursor.

Changes from upstream pstack/ (everything else is byte-for-byte identical):

  1. plugin.json moved from the plugin root to .agenc-plugin/plugin.json,
     because AgenC 0.19.9 rejects a root-level manifest.
  2. The "$schema" key was removed from that manifest, because AgenC 0.19.9
     rejects unknown keys. All other fields and values are unchanged.
  3. Added this NOTICE file.
  4. README.md is replaced by a short AgenC packaging README. The upstream
     README is unchanged at ../pstack/README.md in this fork.

The .cursor-plugin/plugin.json manifest, skills, agents, docs, assets and
automations are unchanged.
